  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN4Lebanon - Facilitating Resettlement of Vulnerable Refugees to Italy 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will facilitate the resettlement of 9 beneficiaries from Lebanon to Italy, including the provision of PDO, PMHA and movement management support. The project - funded by UNHCR - to support the Italian Government fulfilling their resettlement quota is the second phase of the initiative implemented in 2022. IOM will be closely liaise with all relevant stakeholders &#x2013; UNHCR, the Italian Ministry of Interior, the managing authority for the reception centers and health authorities &#x2013; to ensure the safe transfer of the group.</narrative>
  </description>
